@startuml
title Вариант B — failover в Temporal Workflow
autonumber

participant "Temporal Cluster" as Temporal
participant "Delivery Workflow Worker" as Workflow
participant "Push Activity" as Push
participant "Push Provider" as PushProvider
participant "SMS Activity" as SMS
participant "SMS Provider" as SmsProvider
participant "Callback Gateway" as Callback
participant "Audit Activity" as Audit

Temporal -> Workflow: workflow task
Workflow -> Push: ExecuteActivity sendPush(attempt PUSH#1)
Push -> PushProvider: send(idempotency_key)
PushProvider --> Push: accepted, app ack отсутствует
Push --> Workflow: PROVIDER_ACCEPTED
Workflow -> Temporal: durable timer 3 сек + await PUSH_DELIVERED signal

Temporal -> Workflow: timer fired
Workflow -> SMS: ExecuteActivity sendSms(attempt SMS#1)
SMS -> SmsProvider: send(idempotency_key)
SmsProvider --> SMS: accepted + message_id
SMS --> Workflow: PROVIDER_ACCEPTED
Workflow -> Temporal: durable timer 30 сек + await SMS_DLR signal

SmsProvider -> Callback: DLR = DELIVERED
Callback -> Temporal: SignalWorkflow(SMS_DELIVERED)
Temporal -> Workflow: signal event
Workflow -> Audit: Activity append business audit
Workflow -> Temporal: CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via SMS)

... позднее ...
PushProvider -> Callback: поздний push callback
Callback -> Temporal: SignalWorkflow(PUSH_DELIVERED_LATE)
Temporal --> Callback: workflow уже completed
Callback -> Audit: сохранить late callback отдельно

note over Temporal,Workflow
Timer, signal и workflow state хранятся в history.
Retry Policy применяется только к временным ошибкам Activity.
end note

note over Workflow,SMS
Workflow-код выглядит последовательно,
но Activities обязаны быть идемпотентными.
end note
@enduml
